Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||06-25-2001||12:08 PM||||Did you know the GT wheels are polished on the back inside rim also ?  Just like the front outer rim is polished<P>I took my wheels off, to do some clean up & to check the brakes.<P>When I first looked at the backside, they were filthy dirty & all black.  I washed them up, and the black "gook" started to come off.<P>I won't fool you, it took some time to get through all of it, but it's there !!<P>They look great now, the shine is visible looking through the "lace" of the wheel.<BR> (this photo was taken before)<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero_wheel.jpg">    <p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 06-25-2001).]||||reg||5
